<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Learn more about Eat Club, our culinary journey, pristine standards, and our passionate team of master chefs serving delicious flavors since 2015.">
    <title>About Us | Eat Club - Premium Culinary Experience</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
    <style>
        /* Premium custom styling for the About page */
        .about-hero {
            position: relative;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.15) 0%, rgba(247, 147, 30, 0.15) 100%);
            padding: 8rem 2rem 6rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.1);
        }

        .about-hero h2 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dark-color) 30%, var(--primary-color) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .about-hero p {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: #555;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .about-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 5rem;
        }

        .about-image-container {
            position: relative;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            border: 4px solid var(--white);
        }

        .about-image-container img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 450px;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }

        .about-image-container:hover img {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .about-info h3 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: var(--dark-color);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        .about-info h3::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -8px;
            left: 0;
            width: 80px;
            height: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .about-info p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        /* Values Cards styling (Glassmorphism & Gradients) */
        .values-section {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            padding: 5rem 3rem;
            border-radius: 24px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px var(--shadow);
            margin-bottom: 6rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .values-section h3 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
            color: var(--dark-color);
        }

        .values-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 2.5rem;
        }

        .value-card {
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
            transition: var(--transition);
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .value-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 5px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
        }

        .value-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.12);
        }

        .value-card:hover::before {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .value-icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.1) 0%, rgba(247, 147, 30, 0.1) 100%);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem auto;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .value-card:hover .value-icon {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color) 0%, var(--secondary-color) 100%);
            color: var(--white);
            transform: rotate(360deg);
        }

        .value-card h4 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: var(--dark-color);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .value-card p {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Timeline Section */
        .timeline-section {
            margin-bottom: 6rem;
        }

        .timeline-section h3 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
            color: var(--dark-color);
        }

        .timeline {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .timeline::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--primary-color), var(--accent-color));
            top: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 50%;
            margin-left: -2px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .timeline-container {
            padding: 10px 40px;
            position: relative;
            background-color: inherit;
            width: 50%;
        }

        .timeline-container::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            right: -10px;
            background-color: var(--white);
            border: 4px solid var(--primary-color);
            top: 15px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            z-index: 1;
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .left {
            left: 0;
        }

        .right {
            left: 50%;
        }

        .right::after {
            left: -10px;
        }

        .timeline-content {
            padding: 2rem;
            background-color: var(--white);
            position: relative;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .timeline-content:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .timeline-content h4 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .timeline-content p {
            color: #555;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Chefs Section */
        .chefs-section {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .chefs-section h3 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
            color: var(--dark-color);
        }

        .chefs-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 3rem;
        }

        .chef-card {
            background: var(--white);
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px var(--shadow);
            text-align: center;
            transition: var(--transition);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
        }

        .chef-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        .chef-img-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            height: 320px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--secondary-color), var(--primary-color));
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .chef-img-wrapper i.fa-user-tie {
            font-size: 8rem;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .chef-card:hover .chef-img-wrapper i.fa-user-tie {
            transform: scale(1.1) rotate(5deg);
        }

        .chef-details {
            padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
        }

        .chef-details h4 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: var(--dark-color);
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .chef-details span {
            color: var(--primary-color);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .chef-details p {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .chef-socials {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .chef-socials a {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--light-color);
            color: var(--dark-color);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            transition: var(--transition);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .chef-socials a:hover {
            background: var(--primary-color);
            color: var(--white);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        /* Active Nav Styling */
        nav a.active {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            font-weight: 700;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        /* Responsive Breakpoints */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .about-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 2.5rem;
            }

            .about-image-container img {
                height: 350px;
            }

            .timeline::after {
                left: 31px;
            }

            .timeline-container {
                width: 100%;
                padding-left: 70px;
                padding-right: 25px;
            }

            .timeline-container::after {
                left: 21px;
            }

            .right {
                left: 0%;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .about-hero {
                padding: 3.5rem 1.25rem;
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
            }

            .about-hero h2 {
                font-size: clamp(2rem, 9vw, 2.5rem);
            }

            .about-hero p {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }

            .values-section {
                padding: 2.5rem 1rem;
            }

            .timeline-section h3,
            .chefs-section h3,
            .values-section h3 {
                font-size: 2rem;
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
            }

            .timeline-container {
                padding-left: 55px;
                padding-right: 0;
            }

            .timeline-content {
                padding: 1.25rem;
            }

            .about-image-container img {
                height: 280px;
            }
        }

        .about-hero {
            background: #EFE9DE;
            border: 0;
        }

        .about-hero h2 {
            background: none;
            color: var(--dark-color);
            -webkit-text-fill-color: currentColor;
        }

        .about-image-container {
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(41, 53, 46, 0.1);
            border-width: 2px;
        }

        .values-section {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: none;
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: none;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(41, 53, 46, 0.07);
        }

        .value-card:hover .value-icon {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="loading">

    <header>
        <h1>Welcome to Eat Club</h1>
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="/#home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="/menu/">Menu</a></li>
                <li><a href="/about/" class="active">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="/contact/">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- About Hero Section -->
        <section class="about-hero">
            <h2>Our Story & Passion</h2>
            <p>Welcome to Eat Club, where we believe culinary art is a direct link to health, joy, and deep human connection. We compose recipes that celebrate global heritage and pristine quality.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- Our Story Grid -->
        <section class="about-grid">
            <div class="about-image-container">
                <!-- Using a high quality related local image from our assets folder -->
                <img src="/assets/image/Four Cheese Pizza.jpg" alt="Artisan Italian Culinary Creation by Eat Club">
            </div>
            <div class="about-info">
                <h3>Crafting the Extraordinary</h3>
                <p>Eat Club was born in 2015 out of a simple, ambitious desire: to transform ordinary dining into an extraordinary sensory journey. What started as a small, local kitchen has grown into a beloved premium culinary club, delivering exquisite flavors and unmatched variety across the city.</p>
                <p>We source only the freshest, locally farmed ingredients and pair them with authentic global recipes. Our dedicated culinary professionals constantly innovate, bringing you a curated menu that spans across Italian masterpieces, Asian woks, fresh healthy salads, and gourmet desserts.</p>
                <p>Every bite is structured with precise technique and prepared with standard-defining hygienic protocols. Join us, and explore a portal to the absolute world of flavor.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Core Values Section (Glassmorphism design) -->
        <section class="values-section">
            <h3>Our Premium Standards</h3>
            <div class="values-grid">
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-utensils"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4>Exquisite Taste</h4>
                    <p>Prepared by award-winning chefs using premium herbs, spices, and ingredients for authentic flavors.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-truck-loading"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4>Fast & Fresh</h4>
                    <p>Our rapid packing and delivery ecosystem ensures your meals arrive steaming hot and full of life.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-shield-virus"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4>Pristine Hygiene</h4>
                    <p>Strict double-sanitization and contactless kitchens operating with absolute state-of-the-art safety.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-heart"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4>Guest Centric</h4>
                    <p>We offer customized spice levels, customizable ingredients, and friendly, rapid-response customer service.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Timeline Section -->
        <section class="timeline-section">
            <h3>Our Journey of Milestones</h3>
            <div class="timeline">
                <div class="timeline-container left">
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <h4>2015 - The Inception</h4>
                        <p>Opened our very first local cloud kitchen with a compact crew of three chefs and a dream of quality delivery.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-container right">
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <h4>2018 - Menu Revolution</h4>
                        <p>Expanded our culinary scope by bringing in expert Italian pasta masters and traditional Asian wok chefs.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-container left">
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <h4>2021 - Premium Digital Hub</h4>
                        <p>Launched our first state-of-the-art digital ordering platform with interactive real-time trackers and advanced contactless checkout.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-container right">
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <h4>2025 - Global Culinary Club</h4>
                        <p>Now serving thousands of satisfied daily guests with active sustainability packaging and 50+ exquisite global items.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Meet the Team Section -->
        <section class="chefs-section">
            <h3>Our Master Culinary Pioneers</h3>
            <div class="chefs-grid">
                <div class="chef-card">
                    <div class="chef-img-wrapper">
                        <!-- Generates high quality icon illustration to fit modern dark theme -->
                        <i class="fas fa-user-tie"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="chef-details">
                        <h4>Chef Antonio Rossi</h4>
                        <span>Head of Italian Cuisine</span>
                        <p>Bringing 15+ years of Roman tradition. Antonio handles our authentic thin-crust artisan pizzas and premium pastas.</p>
                        <div class="chef-socials">
                            <a href="#" aria-label="Facebook"><i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i></a>
                            <a href="#" aria-label="Instagram"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
                            <a href="#" aria-label="Twitter"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="chef-card">
                    <div class="chef-img-wrapper" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4ecdc4, #45b7d1);">
                        <i class="fas fa-user-tie"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="chef-details">
                        <h4>Chef Maya Lin</h4>
                        <span>Master Wok Specialist</span>
                        <p>Specializes in Cantonese and pan-Asian high-temperature wok-tossing, ensuring robust umami flavors in every single plate.</p>
                        <div class="chef-socials">
                            <a href="#" aria-label="Facebook"><i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i></a>
                            <a href="#" aria-label="Instagram"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
                            <a href="#" aria-label="Twitter"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="chef-card">
                    <div class="chef-img-wrapper" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a78bfa, #8b5cf6);">
                        <i class="fas fa-user-tie"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="chef-details">
                        <h4>Chef Kabir Mehta</h4>
                        <span>Pastry & Dessert Artisan</span>
                        <p>Our sweet-alchemist. Kabir designs our award-winning Classic Tiramisu, cheesecakes, and moist layered red-velvet delicacies.</p>
                        <div class="chef-socials">
                            <a href="#" aria-label="Facebook"><i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i></a>
                            <a href="#" aria-label="Instagram"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
                            <a href="#" aria-label="Twitter"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 Eat Club. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

    <script is:inline src="/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
